---
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const isZh = lang !== 'en';
---
<div class="interactive-frame" data-velocity-gt data-lang={isZh ? 'zh' : 'en'}>
  <div class="vg-head"><strong>{isZh ? 'Conditional vs Marginal Velocity｜條件速度與邊際速度' : 'Conditional vs Marginal Velocity'}</strong><button type="button">{isZh ? '重新抽樣' : 'Resample pair'}</button></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-label={isZh ? '同一 observed state 附近可能有多個 conditional velocities' : 'Multiple conditional velocities near one observed state'}>
    <rect width="760" height="300" rx="12" fill="#101722"/>
    <text x="30" y="28" fill="#dce5ed" font-size="14">{isZh ? '每次點擊都會換一組抽樣的 (x,e)。' : 'Each click changes the sampled (x,e) pair.'}</text>
    <circle cx="380" cy="150" r="12" fill="#f1f4f7" stroke="#778899" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="380" y="185" text-anchor="middle" fill="#dce5ed" font-size="14">{isZh ? '位於相同／鄰近的 z_t' : 'near the same z_t'}</text>
    <g data-arrows></g>
  </svg>
  <div data-text></div>
</div>
<style>.vg-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.vg-head button{padding:.55rem .8rem;border:1px solid #778899;border-radius:.5rem;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}</style>
<script>
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll('[data-velocity-gt]')){if(root.dataset.ready)continue;root.dataset.ready='1';const isZh=root.dataset.lang==='zh';const g=root.querySelector('[data-arrows]'),txt=root.querySelector('[data-text]'),btn=root.querySelector('button');let k=0;const dirs=[[-75,-25],[-30,-80],[20,-65],[65,-20],[80,35],[25,75],[-45,65]];function draw(){g.replaceChildren();const ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';dirs.forEach((d,i)=>{const l=document.createElementNS(ns,'line');l.setAttribute('x1','380');l.setAttribute('y1','150');l.setAttribute('x2',380+d[0]);l.setAttribute('y2',150+d[1]);l.setAttribute('stroke',i===k%dirs.length?'#e5a34e':'#6d7b88');l.setAttribute('stroke-width',i===k%dirs.length?'5':'2');l.setAttribute('stroke-opacity',i===k%dirs.length?'1':'.45');g.appendChild(l)});txt.innerHTML=isZh?`亮色箭頭代表這一次抽到的 <code>e−x</code>。其他淡色箭頭代表在相同／模糊的 <code>z_t</code> 附近可能對應的其他 conditional velocities。MSE regression 對應的 marginal field 是條件平均：<code>v(z,t)=E[e−x | z,t]</code>。`:`Highlighted arrow = one sampled <code>e−x</code>. Other faded arrows represent other conditional velocities compatible with nearby/ambiguous states. The regression field is their conditional mean: <code>v(z,t)=E[e−x | z,t]</code>.`;k++}btn.addEventListener('click',draw);draw()}
</script>
